encoding  utf-8
survey HippoSump

input HippoSump.th2

map HippoSumpM
  HippoSumpSPl1
endmap

centreline
  date 2011.07.30
  
  team "Duncan Price" notes
   
  explo-date 2011.07.30
  explo-team "Duncan Price" 
 
data normal from to compass tape clino
X  0  -  1.5  down
#station X is OverPot.1.1
  
data diving from to fromdepth todepth compass tape ignoreall
0 1 0 -5 220 10
1 2 -5 -7 180 10
2 3 -7 -9 220 10

data dimensions station left right up down
1 1.5 0.5 0.7 0.7
2 0.5 0.7 0.7 0.5
3 0.5 0.5 1.0 0.0
  
  
endcentreline
endsurvey

